@emontnemery there is no need to hunt anything if the user is prompted for the days range during the initial setup in the UI like numerous other integrations do with relevant parameters.
Earlier arguments vary wildly from possibly increased server load with larger search day ranges to "a few days should be enough for most".
I get your idea to not bother the user at all but still believe that in this case simply letting the user decide will be the most practical solution.
